WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.112
Who is this for?

2
00:00:01.112 --> 00:00:04.617
Developers build it, and
identity engineers and the I

3
00:00:04.617 --> 00:00:08.201
S S O's review every Conditional
Access change it makes.

4
00:00:08.201 --> 00:00:11.338
The permissions split
cleanly into two tasks.

5
00:00:11.338 --> 00:00:13.605
Reading needs three read permissions,

6
00:00:13.605 --> 00:00:17.288
and the code picks narrower ones
than the obvious broad choice.

7
00:00:17.288 --> 00:00:21.288
Applying adds exactly two write
permissions, and nothing else.

8
00:00:21.288 --> 00:00:24.997
Learn notes a known issue that may
ask for more consent on create,

9
00:00:24.997 --> 00:00:27.726
and the test-tenant lab
records whether it does.

10
00:00:27.726 --> 00:00:31.850
A test keeps each task's permissions
equal to the calls it makes.
